The one-line memory trick
Bottom View = BFS + Horizontal Distance + Last/Deepest Node per HD

And for your exact code, the three things to remember are:

left child  → hd - 1
right child → hd + 1
same hd     → overwrite

That is the core pattern behind Bottom View of Binary Tree.
